flowchart TD
    A([Employee attribute changes])
    --> B[Re-evaluate current User Groups]
    --> C{Still matches group?}

    C -- Yes --> D([No membership change])

    C -- No --> E[Remove User Group membership]
    --> F[Remove Roles delivered by this Group]
    --> G{Role still granted through another Group?}

    G -- Yes --> H[Keep access from remaining Group]
    G -- No --> I[Remove resulting access]

    H --> J([Completed])
    I --> J
